0..75 Comment "// What forgetting a manifest carrier refuses: a model of a theory with the"
76..152 Comment "// counter\'s carrier but not its reading is no counter once forgotten, and a"
153..226 Comment "// model fixing one sort is no model fixing another (#2132). Two counters"
227..301 Comment "// whose carriers are not shared do not mix, a counter has no sort but its"
302..377 Comment "// carrier, and a sort a type fixing another leaves a field is not read off"
378..404 Comment "// its binder yet (#2131)."
405..479 Comment "// `../../model/identity/model-counter-manifest.gandr` forgets a counter\'s"
480..555 Comment "// manifest carrier, a counter\'s manifest readings alone, and a carrier two"
556..574 Comment "// counters share."
576..631 Comment "// The counter, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
